  "unknowns": [
    "Physical PCB revision and actual fitting were not inspected; software acceptance is not physical HIL.",
    "The schematic marks IS62WV51216 SRAM, W25Q128 NOR and the backup battery as unpopulated. No external memory or NOR population is selected by default.",
    "Only D0/LED0 PG13 and D1/LED1 PG14 are drawn; PG15 LED2 is a net/export, not a third fitted LED.",
    "Only S2/PF6 and S3/PF7 are drawn as keys; PF8 KEY2 is a net/export. The keys have no drawn external pullups; select input mode and explicit internal pullup.",
    "USART1 PA9/PA10 connects to CH340C, not the V3.1 MAX232/P14 path; automatic-download modem signals can reset or alter boot state.",
    "CAN pads are exported without a drawn on-board transceiver. An external-transceiver selection is a declaration, not proof of fitted hardware or termination.",
    "PB3/PB4 NOR pads conflict with full JTAG/SWO. Reviewed NOR selection requires SWD; PA13/PA14 remain reserved.",
    "Core P4 SWC/SWD labels differ from the U1 JTCK/JTMS labels; verify the CAD netlist or physical continuity.",
    "Both USB connectors share VCC5 without drawn source isolation; commissioning must select a reviewed power path.",
    "ILI9341/XPT2046 identities are user-declared; actual fitting and remaining module types are unconfirmed. No advanced module is selected by default. SRAM/LCD bus owners, SDIO, RTC and other incomplete providers are not declared supported by these Board facts.",
